, "line": 10}, {"w": "That's", "t": 42.56, "d": 0.44, "line": 10}, {"w": "still", "t": 43.0, "d": 0.14, "line": 10}, {"w": "the", "t": 43.14, "d": 0.14, "line": 10}, {"w": "Hindi", "t": 43.28, "d": 0.14, "line": 10}, {"w": "word", "t": 43.42, "d": 0.24, "line": 10}, {"w": "for", "t": 43.66, "d": 0.18, "line": 10}, {"w": "orange", "t": 43.84, "d": 0.24, "line": 10}, {"w": "today", "t": 44.08, "d": 0.34, "line": 10}, {"w": "So", "t": 44.76, "d": 0.4, "line": 11}, {"w": "what", "t": 45.16, "d": 0.7, "line": 11}, {"w": "do", "t": 45.86, "d": 0.08, "line": 11}, {"w": "you", "t": 45.94, "d": 0.1, "line": 11}, {"w": "call", "t": 46.04, "d": 0.18, "line": 11}, {"w": "it?", "t": 46.22, "d": 0.2, "line": 11}], "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "This fruit left India... travelled the whole world... and got a new name everywhere it went.", "t0": 0.125, "t1": 5.224, "pauses": [0.38]}, {"i": 1, "text": "In Sanskrit, it was \"naranga.\"", "t0": 5.307, "t1": 7.37, "pauses": []}, {"i": 2, "text": "Persian traders took it home as \"narang\"... and named the color after it too.", "t0": 7.453, "t1": 11.077, "pauses": [0.67]}, {"i": 3, "text": "Arabic had no \"g\" sound. So \"narang\" became \"naranj.\" Then in Portugal: \"laranja.\"", "t0": 11.16, "t1": 17.026, "pauses": [0.48, 0.59, 0.56, 0.47]}, {"i": 4, "text": "In Europe, \"a narange\" slowly turned into \"an orange\"... the N just fell off.", "t0": 17.109, "t1": 22.745, "pauses": [0.45]}, {"i": 5, "text": "Then the Portuguese sailed to China... and found a sweeter one, sweet enough to eat like candy.", "t0": 22.829, "t1": 27.728, "pauses": []}, {"i": 6, "text": "They grew it in a little town called Sintra... and Europe went crazy for it.", "t0": 27.812, "t1": 31.739, "pauses": [0.49]}, {"i": 7, "text": "The Dutch still call it \"China's apple.\"", "t0": 31.822, "t1": 34.205, "pauses": [0.44]}, {"i": 8, "text": "In the 1500s, Portuguese ships brought it to India... as the orange from Sintra.", "t0": 34.288, "t1": 38.924, "pauses": [0.37]}, {"i": 9, "text": "Now say \"Sintra\" ten times fast...", "t0": 39.216, "t1": 41.335, "pauses": []}, {"i": 10, "text": "Santra! That's still the Hindi word for orange today.", "t0": 41.544, "t1": 44.631, "pauses": [0.63]}, {"i": 11, "text": "So... what do you call it?", "t0": 44.715, "t1": 46.604, "pauses": []}]}